OL,3,GNEWSAMTV Dirty Sanchez star Michael
OL,4,A'Pancho' Locke dies aged 47
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to Michael
OL,7,FLocke, star of MTV stunt and prank
OL,8,Fseries Dirty Sanchez, who has died aged
OL,9,F47.
OL,11,FLocke, from Port Talbot, known as
OL,12,F'Pancho', starred in the show, and
OL,13,Flater went on to launch the Welsh
OL,14,Fclothing brand San Portablo.
OL,16,FHis Dirty Sanchez co-star Mathew
OL,17,FPritchard posted a tribute on social
OL,18,Fmedia, saying he "was the best" and he
OL,19,Fwould "never forget him".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
